WEBVTT

00:04.650 --> 00:07.925
Note: This video is part of your Module 1 classroom

00:07.925 --> 00:10.800
instruction. The visit and tour of the mine,

00:10.800 --> 00:13.737
required by Part 48, is a separate,

00:13.737 --> 00:15.100
in-person step.

00:18.425 --> 00:21.875
Welcome to Clover Bottom Quarry #1 and #2.

00:21.875 --> 00:24.062
This video walks you through the site before your

00:24.062 --> 00:26.762
in-person tour, so you know where things are and

00:26.762 --> 00:29.700
how we work here. Clover Bottom is both a surface

00:29.700 --> 00:32.650
quarry and an underground mine. It produces crushed

00:32.650 --> 00:36.499
stone, from base and DGA to clean stone sizes.

00:37.630 --> 00:39.780
Every shift starts at the tag board.

00:39.780 --> 00:42.280
Hang your tag when you arrive, and take it down

00:42.280 --> 00:44.930
when you leave. That's how we know who's on site

00:44.930 --> 00:48.080
in an emergency. Visitors use a separate check-in.

00:51.417 --> 00:53.542
Here's how traffic moves on this site.

00:53.542 --> 00:56.317
Haul trucks run from the surface pit and the underground

00:56.317 --> 00:58.630
mine to the plant; road trucks come through the

00:58.630 --> 01:01.830
scale. Pedestrians stay on the marked walkways,

01:01.830 --> 01:04.517
and nobody walks on a haul road. The speed limit

01:04.517 --> 01:07.367
is 15 miles per hour everywhere on site.

01:07.367 --> 01:09.704
Traffic is two-way and keeps right,

01:09.704 --> 01:11.629
and haul trucks have the right of way.

01:11.629 --> 01:14.204
In a pickup, call the haul truck on the radio before

01:14.204 --> 01:16.855
you approach it. Watch for overhead power lines

01:16.855 --> 01:19.817
on the surface and in Mine 1. Remember:

01:19.817 --> 01:22.092
make contact with an operator and get an answer

01:22.092 --> 01:24.717
back before you approach any equipment.

01:25.850 --> 01:28.662
We communicate by radio; your supervisor will give

01:28.662 --> 01:31.688
you the channels and call words. Warning signals

01:31.688 --> 01:35.100
here include the horn and backup alarms on equipment,

01:35.100 --> 01:37.362
the plant start-up horn, and the blast warning

01:37.362 --> 01:38.175
signal.

01:41.520 --> 01:44.283
The basic cycle here is drill, blast,

01:44.283 --> 01:48.096
load, haul and crush. Drilling and blasting are

01:48.096 --> 01:50.883
done by our own Allen crew, both in the surface

01:50.883 --> 01:54.171
pit and underground. In the pit, benches are about

01:54.171 --> 01:57.620
65 feet high. Underground, the rooms are about

01:57.620 --> 02:00.683
30 by 40 feet. You'll see both for yourself on

02:00.683 --> 02:03.633
your mine tour. Never work near a highwall or with

02:03.633 --> 02:04.796
your back to one.

02:05.922 --> 02:08.023
The plant is where you'll find crushers,

02:08.023 --> 02:11.097
screens and conveyors; stay on walkways and out

02:11.097 --> 02:13.785
of guarded areas. The shop has its own rules for

02:13.785 --> 02:16.635
lockout and hot work. The scale house is where

02:16.635 --> 02:18.972
trucks are weighed before they leave the pit.

02:22.288 --> 02:24.975
In an emergency, go to the gathering point:

02:24.975 --> 02:28.600
Tag Board, or Old Mine Entrance, or Red Gate Hall Road

02:28.600 --> 02:30.088
to the blacktop plant.

02:31.260 --> 02:34.697
For a serious injury or fire, call 911.

02:34.697 --> 02:38.310
Jackson County E911 dispatches all three.

02:38.310 --> 02:43.835
Tell them: Clover Bottom Quarry, 12420 US-421 N,

02:43.835 --> 02:46.322
McKee, and where the injured person is:

02:46.322 --> 02:50.197
underground, pit, plant, scale or shop.

02:50.197 --> 02:52.410
Then call the mine office so someone meets the

02:52.410 --> 02:55.597
ambulance at the gate. Nearby hospitals are AdventHealth

02:55.597 --> 02:58.660
Manchester, Saint Joseph Berea, Baptist Health

02:58.660 --> 02:59.485
Richmond.

03:00.604 --> 03:03.054
Your in-person mine tour is the next,

03:03.054 --> 03:05.516
separate step. Ask questions about anything you

03:05.516 --> 03:06.254
see.

03:07.366 --> 03:10.528
Remember: your site's plans and procedures always

03:10.528 --> 03:12.029
override this video.
